<title>USA: Bell Atlantic to buy 5.8 pct Omnitel stake.</title>
<headline>Bell Atlantic to buy 5.8 pct Omnitel stake.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bell Atlantic said Tuesday it would acquire another 5.8 percent stake in Italy's mobile phone group Omnitel from Olivetti, making it the second largest Omnitel shareholder with a 17.4 percent stake.</p>
<p>Bell Atlantic and Olivetti, Omnitel's largest shareholder, said the deal would close before the end of the year.</p>
</text>
